* sg13g2-lc-pll :: sim/vco-prescaler-load -- the pinned sg13g2-vco with and without the prescaler on the tank (gate G2).
* NOT a standalone deck. scripts/run-vco-prescaler-load.sh prepends the fetched, sha256-verified design/vco.spice
* (everything before its own .control block, placeholders substituted, netlist untouched) and appends this file.
* @@LOAD@@ is either the prescaler instance below ("loaded") or nothing ("unloaded"); the two runs differ in
* nothing else. Nominal corner only: hbt_typ / mos_tt / cap_typ, 27 C, 3.3 V.
*
* IAC is an AC-only differential current probe across the tank (DC 0, so it does not touch the transient).
@@LOAD@@
IAC outp outn dc 0 ac 1

.control
pre_osdi @@OSDI@@
save all
op
ac lin 301 3e9 6e9
wrdata @@OUT@@/ac_@@TAG@@ v(outp)-v(outn)
foreach vv 0 1.65 3.3
  alter VCT dc = $vv
  tran 1p 20n 0 2p
  let vdiff = v(outp) - v(outn)
  wrdata @@OUT@@/tran_@@TAG@@_$vv vdiff
end
.endc
.end
